{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52516","headline":"五言奉和姚元崇相公过楼岩寺诗（题拟） · 韦元旦","name":"五言奉和姚元崇相公过楼岩寺诗（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岩突金银台，登攀信美哉！白林丛万壑，珠缀结三台。\n应物尽标胜，冥心无去来。\n{汞夆/金}明巾铁柱，长欲助盐梅。\n（录自清胡聘之《山右石刻丛编》卷五）（按：此诗刻於姚崇五言《过楼岩寺》後，题仅作「五言奉和」，下署：「前朝议郎行左台监察御史摄宫尹司直韦元旦。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦元旦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52516.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52516","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}